    "project": "research/negation_pullback_audit_20261115/lean",
    "theorem": "NegationPullbackAudit.negation_pullback_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem negation_pullback_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K), Function.Involutive (coordinateNeg W) ∧ Function.Involutive (fieldNeg W)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (x y : K) (h : W.Nonsingular x y) (f : W.FunctionField), finiteAdic W h (fieldNeg W f) = finiteAdic W ((W.nonsingular_neg x y).mpr h) f) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (f : W.FunctionField) (P : W.Point), pointOrder W (fieldNeg W f) P = pointOrder W f (-P)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (f : W.FunctionField) (hf : f ≠ 0), functionDivisor W (fieldNeg W f) (field_neg_nonzero W hf) = divisorNeg W (functionDivisor W f hf)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (a : W.CoordinateRing), polynomialFunction W (Algebra.norm K[X] a) = algebraMap W.CoordinateRing W.FunctionField a * fieldNeg W (algebraMap W.CoordinateRing W.FunctionField a)) ∧ controlFunction ≠ 0 ∧ pointOrder controlCurve controlFunction controlPoint = 3 ∧ pointOrder controlCurve controlFunction (-controlPoint) = 0 ∧ pointOrder controlCurve controlFunction controlPoint ≠ pointOrder controlCurve controlFunction (-controlPoint) ∧ pointOrder controlCurve (fieldNeg controlCurve controlFunction) controlPoint = 0",
    "decl_sha256": "aeb39697095990a68ba9433163f8b7fa516850bef89f64e69f2b1a4ecac6ed1e",
    "scope": "Actual Weierstrass negation pullback, constructed on actual AdjoinRoot coordinate ring, full actual FunctionField and actual point localizations, for every field/general model with nonsingular-point guards. Actual coordinate involution fixes coefficient polynomials and has explicit Y→−Y−a1X−a3/basis formulas; squares to identity, not exact order2 for every characteristic/model. Actual algebra norm preserved; evaluation derives actual prime-complement denominator correspondence and actual localization RingEquiv. Actual field inclusion commutes, maximal ideals and uniformizer generators transport. Earlier actual nonsingularity-derived DVR/fullfractionring and actual unit-times-integer-power theorem derive official normalized finite-adic pullback for every actual function, including zero; no valuation-invariance premise. Actual norm-degree/infinity-adic identity gives all-point-order pullback and actual finite-support functionDivisor transport by point-negation Finsupp permutation. Actual coordinate algebra norm equals product with actual conjugation; identity extends to actual function-field fractions. Actual nonzero tangent on actual nonsingular F5 curve y²=x³+1 at actual3torsionP=(0,1) has order3atP and0at−P; correct pulledback order0. This disproves dropping function pullback, while qualified GalbraithLemma7.7.12 survives.47modules39exactcredited+8new/defaults/standardfoundations. Over arbitraryK actualnonsingularKpoints; ellipticmodeloveralgclosedK includesallgeometricpoints. Separate Scheme.localRing/Divisor APIcomparison, geometric degreezero/constantkernel/uniqueness, algebraicclosurebasechange, translation/reciprocity/isogeny/Lang/Cartier/Jacobian/canonicalWeil-Tate/MOVFR/full14 remainopen. Samehost/prover/Mathlib; nativeheaderproceduralonly/notcompiler-parser-physicalhostrefinement. No novelty/canonicalpromotion/signedstandingclaim.",
